"The mechanism is an explicit evaluated flag carried on every subject result. When the flag is absent, the result is not a failure and the reason reads that the result has not been entered yet. The consequences are propagated consistently through every surface. A pending subject earns no credits but is counted separately rather than being treated as a failure. A student's overall result is complete only when every offered subject carries a verdict, and the student passes overall only when the result is complete and every subject passes. Report generation is refused for a class in which any student's result is incomplete, and the refusal names the subjects and the students involved rather than merely denying the request.",
